strategies is evident. The system prioritizes find-
ing true positives while keeping false positives at a
controlled, low level.H Ablation 7: Fitness Function Weight
Analysis
We address the query regarding the fixed weights
used in our overall fitness function.
Table 8: Robustness analysis of CTUS detection accu-
racy (Acc@1) under different fitness function weight
configurations (Llama-2-7B, 1 Trojan Agent). The sys-
tem maintains stable performance despite varying prior-
ities.
Configuration Weights (w h, wc, wr) Acc@1 (%)
Balanced (Default) 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 79.11
